# Trivy ignore file — findings triaged and tracked.
# Format: one CVE per line (blank lines allowed, lines starting with # are comments).
# Recheck cadence: every CI run — remove an entry as soon as the underlying
# image rebuilds with the fix.

# CVE-2026-7210 — python: expat DoS (HIGH), fixed in python3 3.14.7-r0.
# Affects copyparty/ac:latest (alpine 3.24.1 base, python3 3.14.5-r0).
# Triaged 2026-08-15: denial-of-service in an internet-exposed but
# personal file share (cloud.milisource.org) — no RCE/unauth access
# path. Upstream image must rebuild with python3 >= 3.14.7-r0; remove
# this entry once `docker run --rm copyparty/ac:latest python3 -V`
# reports >= 3.14.7 (check the CI scan log for the fixed version).
CVE-2026-7210
# CVE-2026-45447 + 24 Go stdlib/x-* CVEs — crazymax/diun:latest
